# Terraform working directories and any state, anywhere under this package —
# defense in depth on top of the per-stack .gitignore files. Lock files
# (.terraform.lock.hcl) in stacks/ ARE committed on purpose.
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/crash.log
# A saved plan (terraform plan -out) carries every sensitive value the
# stack renders, the compose bundle's secrets included.
**/*.tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars.json
modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl
